        <body>
            <div xml:id="d584">

                <pb facs="0629" n="621" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg621"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2231/399: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-06-01T18:00:00-05:00">June 1, 1939—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 2—1 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>43. Procedure outlined in my telegram No. 42, May 30, 3 p.m. has been carried
                    out. Foreign Minister offered to send a note today, after <pb facs="0630"
                        n="622" xml:id="pg622"/> confirming figures of 34 percent mentioned in our
                    note, agreeing thereto, but owing to illness of Ortiz he says that he cannot do
                    so until tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
